---
title: "Mockup E — Photo of the month"
description: "Unlisted mockup. How a resident photo contest and winners archive could read."
permalink: /mockups/photos/contest/
bodyClass: page mockup
mockSlug: contest
---
{% from "partials/mock-photo.njk" import photoImg, credit %}
{% set concept = mockPhotos.concepts[mockSlug] %}
{% set photo = mockPhotos.photos[mockPhotos.currentId] %}
<main id="main" class="in page civic mock-page" data-pagefind-ignore>
  {% include "partials/mock-note.njk" %}
  <header class="civic-head">
    <h1 class="page-title">{{ "Photo of the month" | balancedTitle | safe }}</h1>
    <p class="lede">A sample of a resident contest. Nothing here is a town rule yet. The photographs are licensed stand-ins, credited below, not entries.</p>
  </header>

  <div class="photo-slot">
    <figure class="winner" data-photo-frame>
      {{ photoImg(photo, "eager", "(min-width: 1220px) 1148px, 100vw", "high") }}
      <figcaption>
        <b class="winner-theme">Sample theme: the town from above</b>
        <p class="photo-credit">{{ credit(photo) | safe }} A published winner would name the resident instead.</p>
      </figcaption>
    </figure>
    <p class="photo-empty">No photograph published this month. The rules below still stand, and the archive keeps earlier winners.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="prose">
    <h2 class="sign"><span class="blaze" aria-hidden="true"></span>How to enter</h2>
    <ol>
      <li>Take one photograph in Franconia during the month.</li>
      <li>Email it to [email]. Use the subject line “Photo of the month” and the month.</li>
      <li>Give your name as you want it printed, the place in town, and a sentence that the town may publish the photograph here with that credit.</li>
    </ol>
    <p>The Selectboard, or a committee the Selectboard names, picks one photograph. It is the photograph of the month, then it moves to the archive on this page.</p>

    <h2 class="sign"><span class="blaze" aria-hidden="true"></span>Sample rules</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Open to people who live in Franconia.</li>
      <li>The photograph is your own, taken that month, of a place in town.</li>
      <li>One entry per person each month.</li>
      <li>Do not send a photograph that shows a child’s face unless a parent or guardian agrees in the email.</li>
      <li>The town may decline an entry, or skip a month.</li>
      <li>You keep the copyright. Emailing the photograph gives the town permission to show it on this website, with your name, for as long as this archive is published.</li>
    </ul>
  </div>

  <h2 id="archive" class="sign"><span class="blaze" aria-hidden="true"></span>Earlier stand-ins</h2>
  <ul class="archive-list">
    {% for item in mockPhotos.archive %}
      {% set shot = mockPhotos.photos[item.id] %}
      <li>
        <article class="archive-card">
          {{ photoImg(shot, "lazy", "(min-width: 800px) 360px, 92vw", "") }}
          <div>
            <h3>{{ item.month }}</h3>
            <p><b>{{ item.theme }}.</b> {{ credit(shot) | safe }}</p>
          </div>
        </article>
      </li>
    {% endfor %}
  </ul>

  <div id="credits">
    {% include "partials/mock-credits.njk" %}
  </div>
</main>
